<title>EU: EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 30-SUNDAY, JAN 5.</title>
<headline>EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 30-SUNDAY, JAN 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>MONDAY, DECEMBER 30</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
<p>TUESDAY, DECEMBER 31</p>
<p>- Irish EU presidency ends. The Netherlands takes over to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, JANUARY 1</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
<p>THURSDAY, JANUARY 2</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
<p>FRIDAY, JANUARY 3</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
<p>SATURDAY, JANUARY 4</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
<p>SUNDAY, JANUARY 5</p>
<p>No events scheduled</p>
